TITLE: Mastra Client API: Agents
DESCRIPTION: Methods for interacting with Mastra AI agents, including retrieving agents, generating responses, streaming, and managing agent tools and evaluations.

SOURCE: https://github.com/mastra-ai/mastra/blob/main/client-sdks/client-js/README.md#_snippet_3

LANGUAGE: APIDOC
CODE:
```
MastraClient.getAgents()
  - Retrieves a list of all available agents.

MastraClient.getAgent(agentId: string)
  - Returns an instance of a specific agent.
  - Agent Instance Methods:
    - agent.details(): Retrieves detailed information about the agent.
    - agent.generate(params: { messages: Array<{role: string, content: string}> }): Generates a response from the agent based on provided messages.
    - agent.stream(params: { messages: Array<{role: string, content: string}> }): Streams a response from the agent.
    - agent.getTool(toolId: string): Retrieves details for a specific tool associated with the agent.
    - agent.evals(): Retrieves the evaluation history for the agent.
    - agent.liveEvals(): Retrieves ongoing live evaluations for the agent.
```

