TITLE: AgentNetwork API Reference
DESCRIPTION: Provides details on the AgentNetwork constructor and its methods, including parameters, return types, and functionality for managing agent networks and their interactions.

SOURCE: https://github.com/mastra-ai/mastra/blob/main/docs/src/content/en/reference/networks/agent-network.mdx#_snippet_1

LANGUAGE: APIDOC
CODE:
```
AgentNetwork Constructor:
  constructor(config: AgentNetworkConfig)
    - Initializes a new AgentNetwork.
    - Parameters:
      - config: Configuration object for the AgentNetwork.
        - name: string - Name of the network.
        - instructions: string - Instructions for the routing agent.
        - model: LanguageModel - Language model to use for routing.
        - agents: Agent[] - Array of specialized agents in the network.

AgentNetwork Methods:

  generate(messages: string | string[] | CoreMessage[], args?: AgentGenerateOptions): Promise<GenerateTextResult>
    - Generates a response using the agent network. This method has replaced the deprecated `run()` method.
    - Parameters:
      - messages: The input messages for the network.
      - args: Optional generation options.
    - Returns: A promise that resolves to the generation result.

  stream(messages: string | string[] | CoreMessage[], args?: AgentStreamOptions): Promise<StreamTextResult>
    - Streams a response using the agent network.
    - Parameters:
      - messages: The input messages for the network.
      - args: Optional streaming options.
    - Returns: A promise that resolves to the streaming result.

  getRoutingAgent(): Agent
    - Returns the routing agent used by the network.
    - Returns: The routing Agent instance.

  getAgents(): Agent[]
    - Returns the array of specialized agents in the network.
    - Returns: An array of Agent instances.

  getAgentHistory(agentId: string): Array<{ input: string, output: string, timestamp: string }>
    - Returns the history of interactions for a specific agent.
    - Parameters:
      - agentId: The unique identifier of the agent.
    - Returns: An array of interaction objects for the specified agent.

  getAgentInteractionHistory(): Record<string, Array<{ input: string, output: string, timestamp: string }>>
    - Returns the history of all agent interactions that have occurred in the network.
    - Returns: A record mapping agent IDs to their interaction histories.

  getAgentInteractionSummary(): string
    - Returns a formatted summary of agent interactions in chronological order.
    - Returns: A string summarizing the network's interactions.
```

